 Bushing&reg; bearing plate to rotate about its center</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides twice the load capacity of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and six times the load capacity of conventional linear bearings</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides eight times the travel life of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and 216 times the travel life of conventional linear bearings</li><li>Its unique design with the steel band enables the bearing to preserve it&apos;s ID fit-up and self-aligning capability over extended use</li><li>A universal self-alignment feature optimizes load distribution between ball tracks and assures uniform ball loading over the entire length of the bearing plate</li><li>This patented product provides smooth, quiet, low drag linear movement at 6x the load capacity or 216 x the L10 travel life of a conventional steel linear ball bushing bearing</li><li>These universally self-aligning bearings offer twice the load capacity or eight times the travel life of our Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing</li><li>For class L, continuously supported shafting</li><li>Self-aligning</li><li>No wipers</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SSU12OPN_1.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SSU10OPN.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Length":"2-5/8 in","Load Capacity":"2350 lb Dynamic","Outside Diameter":"2 in","Shaft Diameter":"1-1/4 in","Temperature Rating":"185 deg F","Type":"Adjustable Open","WEIGHT":"0.47 lb"}},"THOMSON:OPN-203242":{"b":"THOMSON","p":"OPN-203242","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>The RoundRail&trade; advantage which minimizes installation time and cost</li><li>Steady state travel speeds up to 10 ft/s and accel