ith universal self-alignment, eliminating the need for derating factors commonly required when using linear guides</li><li>A coefficient of friction as low as 0.001 and allows the use of smaller, less expensive motors, belts, gears and ball screws when replacing high-friction, plain bearings</li><li>Double-lip integral wipers that keep out dirt while retaining lubrication and travel life is maximized</li><li>Steady state travel speeds up to 10 ft/s and accelerations to 450 ft/s without the use of derating factors</li><li>Universal self-alignment</li><li>The bearing plate is designed to rock 0.5 deg about the hardened precision ground outer ring</li><li>The second key design feature of the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate is its ability to roll</li><li>The shape formed by the rock and roll features allows the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate to rotate about its center</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides twice the load capacity of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and six times the load capacity of conventional linear bearings</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides eight times the travel life of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and 216 times the travel life of conventional linear bearings</li><li>Closed pillow blocks are for end supported shafting</li><li>For class L shafting</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_FNYBUPB06_1.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SPB10.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf","Shaft Diameter":"3/4 in","Temperature Rating":"185 deg F","Type":"Non-Adjustable Closed","Width":"2.06 in","Bearing Material":"Steel","Center Line to Base":"0.937 in","Height":"1-3/4 in","Length":"2-3/4 in","Load Capacity":"1130