PB-M-16-A-LS"},"THOMSON:SSEPBM16DD":{"b":"THOMSON","p":"SSEPBM16DD","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>Maintenance free operation</li><li>Eliminates need for expensive lubrication systems</li><li>A precision, super finished, dual track bearing plate for optimum system smoothness and performance</li><li>Longer travel life and minimal machine downtime when replacing conventional linear bearings or the industry standard Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing</li><li>RoundRail&trade; advantage combined with universal self-alignment, eliminating the need for derating factors commonly required when using linear guides</li><li>A coefficient of friction as low as 0.001 and allows the use of smaller, less expensive motors, belts, gears and ball screws when replacing high-friction, plain bearings</li><li>Double-lip integral wipers that keep out dirt while retaining lubrication and travel life is maximized</li><li>Steady state travel speeds up to 10 ft/s and accelerations to 450 ft/s without the use of derating factors</li><li>Universal self-alignment</li><li>The bearing plate is designed to rock 0.5 deg about the hardened precision ground outer ring</li><li>The second key design feature of the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate is its ability to roll</li><li>The shape formed by the rock and roll features allows the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate to rotate about its center</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides twice the load capacity of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and six times the load capacity of conventional linear bearings</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides eight times the travel life of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and 216 times the travel life of conventional linear bearings</li><li>Closed pillow blocks are for end supported shafting</li><li>For metric class shafting</li><li>Self-aligning</li><li>Integral seals both ends</li><li>Seals standard wi