l screws when replacing high-friction, plain bearings</li><li>A self-aligning capability up to 0.5 deg compensates for inaccuracies in base flatness or carriage machining</li><li>Accelerations as high as 150 m/sq-s and steady state travel speeds up to 3 m/s without the derating factors commonly required with linear guides</li><li>Double-lip integral wipers that keep out dirt while retaining lubrication and travel life is maximized</li><li>Lightweight, wear-resistant, engineered polymer retainers and outer sleeves that reduce inertia and noise</li><li>The Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing has been the industry standard for self-aligning linear bearings for over twenty years</li><li>Besides the dramatic increase in load capacity, the Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing is self-aligning, lightweight and adjustable with a low coefficient of friction</li><li>The wear-resistant, engineered-polymer retainers and outer sleeves reduce inertia and noise in critical, high speed applications</li><li>Radially floating bearing plates when installed in an adjustable housing, the Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing may be adjusted to a specific diametrical fit-up for accurate and repeatable movement</li><li>Self-aligning</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SUPER8OPN.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SUPER8OPN_1.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Length":"1-1/4 in","Load Capacity":"255 lb Dynamic","Maximum Speed":"3 m/s","Outside Diameter":"7/8 in","Shaft Diameter":"1/2 in","Temperature Rating":"185 deg F","Type":"Adjustable Open","WEIGHT":"0.05 lb"}},"THOMSON:SUPER-8-OPN-DD*":{"b":"THOMSON","p":"SUPER-8-OPN-DD*","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>A coefficient of friction as low as 0.001 and allows the use of smaller, less expensive motors, belts, gears and