he increase in three times load capacity or travel life</li><li>Zero clearance fit</li><li>Smooth, quiet operation</li><li>Accelerations as high as 150 m/sq-s and steady state travel speeds up to 3 m/s without the derating factors commonly required with linear guides</li><li>Replaceable bearing components for quick, cost-effective machine maintenance and minimal downtime</li><li>Standard, double-acting, integral seals at both ends, which keep out dirt, grit and other contaminants, retain lubrication and maximize bearing life</li><li>Lubrication hole for easy maintenance</li><li>Tapped or thru hole mounting configuration for ease of installation</li><li>Twin version with two Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearings providing twice the load capacity or eight times more travel life than the single version</li><li>A single bearing version that self aligns in all directions, minimizing installation time and cost</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SPTWNM12_1.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_MAPBAM08.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Center Line to Base":"18 mm","Height":"35 mm","Length":"43 mm","Load Capacity":"1350 N Dynamic/1490 N Static","Maximum Speed":"3 m/s","Series":"SPTWN","Shaft Diameter":"12 mm","Temperature Rating":"185 deg F","Type":"Adjustable Closed Twin","Width":"76 mm","WEIGHT":"0.0"}},"INA:KTN16BPPAS":{"b":"INA","p":"KTN16BPPAS"},"NB:TKA16WUU":{"b":"NB","p":"TKA16WUU"},"STAR:1085-816-00":{"b":"STAR","p":"1085-816-00"},"THOMSON:SSETWNM16DD":{"b":"THOMSON","p":"SSETWNM16DD","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>Maintenance free operation</li><li>Eliminates need for expensive lubrication systems</li><li>A precision, super finished, dual track bearing plate for optimum system smoothness and performance</li><li>Longer travel life and minimal machine downtime when replacing conventional linear bearings or the industry standard Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing</li><li>RoundRail&trade; advantage combined with universal self-alignment, eliminating the need for derating factors commonly required when using linear guides</li><li>A coefficient of friction as low as 0.001 and allows the use of smaller, less expensive motors, belts, gears and ball screws when replacing high-friction, plain bearings</li><li>Double-lip integral wipers that keep out dirt while retaining lubrication and travel life is maximized</li><li>Steady state travel speeds up to 10 ft/s and accelerations to 450 ft/s without the use of derating factors</li><li>Universal self-alignment</li><li>The bearing plate is designed to rock 0.5 deg about the hardened precision ground outer ring</li><li>The second key design feature of the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate is its ability to roll</li><li>The shape formed by the rock and roll features allows the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate to rotate about its center</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides twice the load capacity of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and six times the load capacity of conventional linear bearings</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides eight times the travel life of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and 216 times the travel life of conventional linear bearings</li><li>Closed pillow blocks are for end supported shafting</li><li>For metric class shafting</li><li>Self-aligning</li><li>Integral seals both ends</li><li>Seals standard with SSE</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SSETWNM12XS_1.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_MAPBAM08.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_C