b":"JTEKT","p":"G11032RSB"},"FAFNIR:G1103KLLB":{"b":"FAFNIR","p":"G1103KLLB","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>These eccentric wide-inner-ring ball bearings have two mechanical-seals and a provision for relubrication</li><li>Type G-KLLB has a spherical outside diameter</li><li>Type G-KLLB has generally suitable for higher-speed and/or higher temperature applications</li><li>They incorporate non-contact seals, these bearings have very low rotational torque</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Fafnir_1103KRR3.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Fafnir_1103KRR3_1.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Fafnir_1103KRR3_Catalog.pdf Fafnir_1103KRR3_Catalog.pdf | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Fafnir_G1103KLLB_Specification_Sheet.pdf Fafnir_G1103KLLB_Specification_Sheet.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Bore Diameter":"1-3/16 in","Cage Material":"Steel","Closure Type":"Double Seal","Finish":"Uncoated","Load Capacity":"4850 lb Dynamic/2530 lb Static","Maximum Speed":"6520 rpm","Outside Diameter":"2.4409 in","Series":"G-KLLB","Temperature Rating":"-50 to 120 deg C","Type":"Relubricatable Standard Duty","Width":"1-7/16 in","WEIGHT":"0.87 lb"}},"FAFNIR:G1103KLLB3":{"b":"FAFNIR","p":"G1103KLLB3"},"FAFNIR:G1103KPPB4":{"b":"FAFNIR","p":"G1103KPPB4","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>Tri-ply seal bearings are dimensionally interchangeable with KRRB bearings and can be used with standard housings</li><li>One-piece tri-ply seals incorporate a highly effective seal design molded to an exterior shroud-cap, the shroud-cap protects the seal lip from fiber wrap and abrasion</li><li>Supplied with a self-locking collar, the bearings are most effective in environments with severe contamination and moisture</li><li>Relubricatable tri-ply seal bearings are dimensionally interchangeable with G-KRRB bearings</li><li>This design can be used with standard housings</li><li>Eccentric wide-inner-ring</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Fafnir_G1112KPPB4.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Fafnir_1103KRR3_Catalog.pdf Fafnir_1103KRR3_Catalog.pdf | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Fafnir_G1103KPPB4_Specification_Sheet.pdf Fafnir_G1103KPPB4_Specification_Sheet.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Bore Diameter":"1-1/4 in","Cage Material":"Nylon","Closure Type":"Double Seal","Finish":"Uncoated","Load Capacity":"4850 lb Dynamic/2530 lb Static","Maximum Speed":"500 rpm","Outside Diameter":"2.4409 in","Series":"G-KRRB","Temperature Rating":"-50 to 120 deg C","Type":"Relubricatable Standard Duty","Width":"1-7/16 in","WEIGHT":"0.74 lb"}},"CR SEALS:G1103KRR":{"b":"CR SEALS","p":"G1103KRR"},"TIMKEN:WPC103GRC":{"b":"TIMKEN","p":"WPC103GRC"},"SKF:G1103KRR":{"b":"SKF","p":"G1103KRR"},"CR SEALS:G1103KRRB":{"b":"CR SEALS","p":"G1103KRRB"},"SKF:G1103KRRB":{"b":"SKF","p":"G1103KRRB"},"FAFNIR:G1103KRRB":{"b":"FAFNIR","p":"G1103KRRB","s":{"Features":"<ul><li>These bearings are designed for extremely dirty or wet conditions</li><li>The bearing includes R-seals with flared lips that firmly contact the ground outer diameter of the inner-ring</li><li>The inner-ring provides a positive seal against dust, dirt and other contaminants, and effectively retains the lubricant</li><li>The extra-wide design provides additional shaft support and extra-large grease capacity</li><li>G-KRRB series bearings have spherical outside diameters</li><li>Eccentric wide-inner-ring</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Fafnir_1015KRR.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Fafnir_GRA108RRB.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Fafnir_1012KRRB_Catalog.pdf Fafnir_1012KRRB_Catalog.pdf | https://extern